{
  "about": [
    "The consoles of the menu, in menu order.",
    "system: the RetroPie system, which is also the name of its folder under ~/RetroPie/roms.",
    "also: more RetroPie systems that show under the same console. runs_as: the system whose emulators run a folder that is no RetroPie system itself.",
    "logo: the file name of the logo in the theme carbon-2021 or in assets/logos when it differs from the system. logo null shows the name as text.",
    "endings: file endings of games beyond those of the RetroPie system, such as .zip for archives that RetroArch unpacks.",
    "names arcade: the files carry the short names of arcade games (mslug.zip). The full names come from the game lists of the arcade emulators.",
    "strips: patterns for the games whose screenshots make the six strips of the console screen, most wanted first.",
    "A console shows in the menu once its folder holds games."
